# CVE-2026-14456 image base fix, independent review (reserves 3 and 4):
# small, already-sanitized evidence files that ARE meant to be versioned
# live under these two evidence directories (see SUMMARY.json
# evidence_index and each round's own *-summary.json). The blanket "*.log"
# and "screenshots/" rules above exist to exclude real runtime logs and
# ad-hoc local captures elsewhere in the repo; un-ignore only these
# specific evidence subpaths (these negations must stay AFTER the rules
# above, since gitignore applies later rules last).
!.engineering/evidence/cve-2026-14456-image-base-fix/https-rehearsal-reserve3/*.log
!.engineering/evidence/cve-2026-14456-image-base-fix/browser-rehearsal-reserve4/*.log
!.engineering/evidence/cve-2026-14456-image-base-fix/browser-rehearsal-reserve4/screenshots/
